                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7396910f-4dd7-31bc-bdcd-dfb9acded4a8",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tawny, dusky, dark."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2384ddab-7715-32b3-865d-4f26bc6e5222",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dark-skinned; black."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9a60efd-4a1b-4a25-9153-9f9b71d57fd8",
                                "sense_id": "2384ddab-7715-32b3-865d-4f26bc6e5222",
                                "text": "Their swarthy Hosts wou'd darken all our Plains, / Doubling the native Horror of the War, / And making Death more grim."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "acd60ee5-bf30-3847-b3dd-f5a9e4eddb85",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Darker-skinned than white, but lighter-skinned than tawny; tan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0d360d7-4db4-4dcc-a249-8d7579a0af31",
                                "sense_id": "acd60ee5-bf30-3847-b3dd-f5a9e4eddb85",
                                "text": "the Number of purely white People in the World is proportionably very small. All Africa is black or tawny. Asia chiefly tawny. America (exclusive of the new Comers) wholly so. And in Europe, the Spaniards, Italians, French, Russians and Swedes, are generally of what we call a swarthy Complexion; as are the Germans also, the Saxons only excepted, who with the English, make the principal Body of White People"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "488b16e4-f6dd-4a0a-b316-b7fb54b42d68",
                                "sense_id": "acd60ee5-bf30-3847-b3dd-f5a9e4eddb85",
                                "text": "Yossarian went along in Milo Minderbinder's speeding M & M staff car to police headquarters to meet a swarthy, untidy police commissioner with a narrow black mustache and unbuttoned tunic who was fiddling with a stout woman with warts and two chins when they entered his office and who greeted Milo with warm surprise and bowed and scraped in obscene servility as though Milo were some elegant marquis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f66b32a-5bb4-46e7-8db8-82cfab1d2908",
                                "sense_id": "acd60ee5-bf30-3847-b3dd-f5a9e4eddb85",
                                "text": "Such was the religion that a young, swarthy man of medium height took with him as he trudged off to the University of Erfurt in May 1501."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1910a10d-8ca7-3ccd-9a6a-bb80093430d8",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A dark grey color."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e29efb46-f6dc-350e-b5a2-c7806dea217a",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Evil, malicious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nonstandard"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20a3a09d-2002-338c-b9e7-a6a1d41a9f42",
                        "entry_id": "4875ce66-c53e-3cc4-ba00-4c104c93c177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Weathered, rough."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nonstandard"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eea16dd3-4418-49ce-b6ae-3f4b9efc98e4",
                                "sense_id": "20a3a09d-2002-338c-b9e7-a6a1d41a9f42",
                                "text": "Mason: \"Okay, how do I look, really?\"\nBetty: \"…'Swarthy.'\"\nMason: \"Well, is that good?\"\nBetty: \"Depends if you like 'swarthy.'\"\nMason: \"Do you like 'swarthy'?\"\nBetty: \"Not particularly.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
